# CRM Technical Consultant Skill

Technické know-how pro Bloomreach Engagement implementace.

## Klíčové oblasti dokumentace
https://documentation.bloomreach.com/engagement/docs/documentation-overview

### Scénáře (Scenarios)
- Trigger types: event-based, segment-based, date-based
- Node types: message, wait, condition, AB test, update customer
- Exit conditions a frequency capping

### Segmentace
- Customer filters (real-time vs. batch)
- Event-based segmentace
- Predikce (churn, conversion, LTV)

### Emaily
- Template editor (drag & drop vs. HTML)
- Tracking (open, click, unsubscribe)
- Deliverability best practices

### SMS
- Opt-in management
- Character limits a encoding
- Delivery reports

### In-app zprávy
- Trigger conditions
- Display frequency
- Targeting rules

### Webhooky a integrace
- Outgoing webhooks
- API triggery
- Data import/export

### Analytics
- EQL (Engagement Query Language)
- Reporty a dashboardy
- Attribution modely

## Technické checklist pro každý scénář
- [ ] Trigger event je správně definován
- [ ] Segmentace odpovídá cílové skupině
- [ ] Frequency capping nastaven
- [ ] Unsubscribe link v emailu
- [ ] Tracking parametry nastaveny (UTM)
- [ ] A/B test varianta definována
- [ ] Exit condition nastavena
- [ ] Testováno na testovacím zákazníkovi
